keywords Scholomance, Caer Darrow, Western Plaguelands, Eva Sarkhoff, Doctor Theolen Krastinov, Krastinov's Bag of Horrors, Jandice Barov, Kirtonos the Herald, Blood of Innocents, Magistrate Marduke, Ras Frostwhisper, Keepsake of Remembrance, Stromgarde, Leonid Barthalomew, Soulbound Keepsake, Alexi Barov, Barov Family Fortune, The Last Barov, Weldon Barov, Betina Bigglezink, Plagued Hatchlings, Skeleton Key, Light's Hope, the Bulwark, dungeon
why Every Horde quest of Scholomance, with the short returns to Eva Sarkhoff its chain needs.

# Scholomance's Horde quests in one guide: Betina Bigglezink at Light's
# Hope, Alexi Barov at the Bulwark, Eva Sarkhoff by the gate on Caer
# Darrow, the run with short returns to Eva between its parts, Magistrate
# Marduke's chain through Stromgarde, Light's Hope and a short trip into
# Stratholme for Menethil's Gift, then Ras Frostwhisper and the hand-ins. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Eva Sarkhoff's 5382 Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher -> 5515
#   Krastinov's Bag of Horrors -> 5384 Kirtonos the Herald -> Magistrate
#   Marduke's 5461 The Human, Ras Frostwhisper -> 5462 The Dying, Ras
#   Frostwhisper (to Leonid Barthalomew) -> Leonid's 5463 -> 5464 Menethil's
#   Gift (in Stratholme) -> 5465 Soulbound Keepsake -> 5466 The Lich, Ras
#   Frostwhisper. Each of Eva's quests opens only after the last is handed in
#   outside: she stands by the gate, so the guide steps out and back in.
# - Alexi Barov's 5341 Barov Family Fortune -> 5342 The Last Barov.
# - Betina Bigglezink's 5529 Plagued Hatchlings.
#
# The gate: Scholomance's gate needs the Skeleton Key, and one key opens it
# for the group. Its quest chain (from High Executor Derrington's Scarlet
# Diversions to The Key to Scholomance) is not one of the dungeon's quests; Polestar's Dungeons window lists it with the dungeon.
#
# Left out: 5582 Healthy Dragon Scale and the other repeatables (5067, 5068,
# 8829); 4771 Dawn's Gambit (its chain runs through Blackrock Spire's Egg
# Collection); 5167 (it needs the Upper Blackrock Spire's Gyth); 7629 Imp
# Delivery (the warlock epic mount chain); 7479 Libram of Focus (as in the
# Dire Maul guide); the Shamans' 7667 Material Assistance and The Darkreaver
# Menace (the data holds two versions, 7668 and 8258, with the same lead-in,
# and not which one the client gives); the Dungeon Set 2 and Valthalak quests.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses or the objects inside, so
# their goals stand at the gate (@69.7,73.2, Western Plaguelands) with `group
# 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Kirtonos, Jandice Barov, Rattlegore, Marduk Blackpool, Vectus, Ras
# Frostwhisper, Instructor Malicia, Doctor Theolen Krastinov, Lorekeeper
# Polkelt, The Ravenian, Lord Alexei Barov, Lady Illucia Barov, Darkmaster
# Gandling), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted by the quest
# log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each step
# ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon (its note on the Skeleton Key too).
# - The door: QuestieDB's list of Forever's dungeons, as Polestar's Codex holds it
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   58 to 60).
# INGAME: where inside are the Barov deeds and the porch's brazier, and
#   where in Stratholme is Menethil's Gift? Which
#   Darkreaver Menace does Sagorne Creststrider give?

